 THE CHYMISTS ARE A STRANGE CLASS OF MORTALS IMPELLED
 BY AN ALMOST INSANE IMPULSE TO SEEK THEIR PLEASURE
 AMONG SMOKE AND VAPOR, SOOT AND FLAME, POISONS AND
